Startup.FirstRun.Title=First-time notes
Startup.FirstRun.Message=Before starting Desktop Twin, here is what it does:\n\n1. This app runs as administrator and turns on Windows Child Sessions.\n   That is a system-wide setting: it stays after you close the app and is not reverted by a restart.\n2. You can undo it at any time under Control Center → Diagnostics → Turn off Child Sessions (restore the system).\n3. Desktop Twin creates a second desktop for the same account. It is not a sandbox:\n   files and permissions reachable in the twin are exactly the same as on the main desktop.\n\nContinue?
