Fix.DllType.StillWrong=After writing, the type still reads back as something other than REG_EXPAND_SZ, so the fix did not take effect.
Fix.DllType.NeedRestart=The value was written, but the service could not be restarted: {0}. Restart the Remote Desktop service manually and try again.
Fix.DllType.Restored=ServiceDll was written back to the native path as REG_EXPAND_SZ and the Remote Desktop service was restarted.
Fix.ServiceKey.AlreadyOk=The service key fields already match the Windows defaults; nothing to fix.
